# kind	path	arguments: see lay-out-sources
# One tree and one vendored lock per enrolled fuzz target: the release
# layout reads the target's source at /work/ext/<target>/src (ov_target_begin's
# SRCDIR), its Cargo.lock copy at /work/targets/<target>/Cargo.lock and the
# crates that lock names at /work/ext/<target>/vendor. Each tree is a full
# copy of the checkout, so every target's Cargo.lock is laid out before its
# `crates` directive names it.
